From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA Aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 08:15:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(access): reject trailing-dot hosts at policy boundaries

Reject hosts ending in a dot in transport selection, trusted request
context, and published-rule validation. Preserve native routing when no
Access snapshot exists, and test fail-closed behavior after publication.

---
 chrome/browser/aegis/access/access_network_context_transport.cc | 2 +-
 chrome/browser/aegis/access/access_network_context_transport_unittest.cc | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++
 chrome/browser/aegis/access/access_proxying_url_loader_factory_browsertest.cc | 71 ++++++++++++++++++++
 components/aegis_access/access_policy_evaluator.cc | 7 ++++++-
 components/aegis_access/access_policy_evaluator_unittest.cc | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 components/aegis_access/request_policy_context.cc | 7 ++++++-
 components/aegis_access/request_policy_context_unittest.cc | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

